{
  "version": 1,
  "meta": {
    "titulo": "La deriva que dimensiona — §6.1 a §6.4 sobre la torre mixta, y la cepa a mano (NCh2369:2025)",
    "ficha": "struct_pad/src/content/apuntes/ejemplo-torre-deformaciones-nch2369.mdx",
    "esperadoFalso": {
      "v_Y1_cumple": "Es el hallazgo del post: la deriva del piso 1 del MRF (112,2 mm) excede el límite de §6.3 (60 mm). El ✗ es la tesis, no un defecto.",
      "v_Y2_cumple": "Ídem piso 2: 169,5 mm = 2,82 veces el límite — el piso del equipo, el más castigado.",
      "v_Y3_cumple": "Ídem piso 3: 112,1 mm contra 60 mm.",
      "v_excY2_cumple": "La EXCEPCIÓN de §6.3 duplica el límite a 120 mm y el piso 2 sigue un 41 % pasado: ni la excepción salva al marco. Los pisos 1 y 3 sí quedarían bajo el límite duplicado — por eso sus veredictos de excepción son ✓."
    }
  },
  "regions": [
    { "id": "r000", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 32, "src": "LA DERIVA QUE DIMENSIONA — §6.1 a §6.4 sobre la torre mixta (NCh2369:2025)" },
    { "id": "r001", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 80, "src": "Las derivas del MRF/CBF vienen del análisis validado en dos motores (case09 rukan ↔ SAP2000, <0,01 %), combinadas como CQC de derivas modales con el espectro de referencia de §6.1: acá son DATOS. Los límites, la excepción, la Ec. (15) y la cepa entera se rehacen en vivo." },
    { "id": "r002", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 128, "src": "— DATOS · derivas de entrepiso, espectro de referencia §6.1 (mm) —" },
    { "id": "r003", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 176, "src": "D_X1 := 9.561 mm" },
    { "id": "r004", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 224, "src": "D_X2 := 10.121 mm" },
    { "id": "r005", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 272, "src": "D_X3 := 6.368 mm" },
    { "id": "r006", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 320, "src": "D_Y1 := 112.221 mm" },
    { "id": "r007", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 368, "src": "D_Y2 := 169.469 mm" },
    { "id": "r008", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 416, "src": "D_Y3 := 112.137 mm" },
    { "id": "r009", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 464, "src": "— DATOS · geometría y desplazamiento del techo (para la Ec. 15) —" },
    { "id": "r010", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 512, "src": "h := 4 m" },
    { "id": "r011", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 560, "src": "d_top := 391.70 mm" },
    { "id": "r012", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 608, "src": "d_dis3 := 78.34 mm" },
    { "id": "r013", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 656, "src": "Rstar_Y := 5.0" },
    { "id": "r014", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 704, "src": "— 1 · el límite de §6.3 (0,015·h) y sus veredictos —" },
    { "id": "r015", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 752, "src": "d_max := 0.015*h = mm" },
    { "id": "v_X1_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 800, "src": "v_X1_cumple := D_X1 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_X2_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 848, "src": "v_X2_cumple := D_X2 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_X3_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 896, "src": "v_X3_cumple := D_X3 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "r019", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 944, "src": "uso_CBF := D_X2/d_max = " },
    { "id": "r020", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 992, "src": "El CBF pasa usando el 17 % de su límite: la diagonal convierte la deriva en rigidez axial." },
    { "id": "v_Y1_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1040, "src": "v_Y1_cumple := D_Y1 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_Y2_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1088, "src": "v_Y2_cumple := D_Y2 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_Y3_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1136, "src": "v_Y3_cumple := D_Y3 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "r024", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1184, "src": "razon_Y2 := D_Y2/d_max = " },
    { "id": "r025", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1232, "src": "Los tres ✗ son el hallazgo: el MRF que aprobaba en fuerza reprueba en deriva, hasta 2,82×." },
    { "id": "r026", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1280, "src": "— 2 · la EXCEPCIÓN de §6.3: límites al doble si no se compromete la operación —" },
    { "id": "r027", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1328, "src": "d_max2 := 2*d_max = mm" },
    { "id": "v_excY1_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1376, "src": "v_excY1_cumple := D_Y1 <= d_max2 = " },
    { "id": "v_excY2_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1424, "src": "v_excY2_cumple := D_Y2 <= d_max2 = " },
    { "id": "v_excY3_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1472, "src": "v_excY3_cumple := D_Y3 <= d_max2 = " },
    { "id": "r031", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1520, "src": "El piso 2 sigue un 41 % pasado del límite duplicado: no hay lectura de la cláusula que salve al marco." },
    { "id": "r032", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1568, "src": "— 3 · el disparador de §6.4: P-Delta se debe considerar si la deformación excede 0,015·h —" },
    { "id": "v_pdelta_Y", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1616, "src": "v_pdelta_Y := max(D_Y1, D_Y2, D_Y3) > d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_pdelta_X_no", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1664, "src": "v_pdelta_X_no := max(D_X1, D_X2, D_X3) <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "r035", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1712, "src": "v_pdelta_Y ✓ = el análisis del MRF debe incluir P-Delta; v_pdelta_X_no ✓ = en el CBF ni se activa (C6.4)." },
    { "id": "r036", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1760, "src": "— 4 · separación entre estructuras, Ec. (15): D ≥ κ·√(d_i² + d_j²) —" },
    { "id": "r037", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1808, "src": "kappa := 1.2" },
    { "id": "r038", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1856, "src": "D_gemela := kappa*sqrt(d_top^2 + d_top^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "r039", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 1904, "src": "D_rigida := kappa*sqrt(d_top^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "r040", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 1952, "src": "Dos tercios de metro de junta contra una gemela (κ = 1,5 si la condición es crítica, §6.2.1)." },
    { "id": "r041", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2000, "src": "— 5 · el chequeo de escala: referencia = R*·diseño (linealidad, validado a 1e-9) —" },
    { "id": "v_escala", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2048, "src": "v_escala := abs(d_top/(d_dis3*Rstar_Y) - 1) < 0.001 = " },
    { "id": "r043", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2096, "src": "— 6 · LA CEPA A MANO — los modos del primer ejemplo bajo el espectro de referencia —" },
    { "id": "r044", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 2144, "src": "Datos: Tablas 3 y 6 (zona 3, suelo D), Tabla 7 (ξ), y los modos del modelo 2 GDL del ejemplo de la cepa." },
    { "id": "r045", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2192, "src": "A_r := 0.56" },
    { "id": "r046", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2240, "src": "S := 1.00" },
    { "id": "r047", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2288, "src": "r := 3.50" },
    { "id": "r048", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2336, "src": "T_0 := 0.60 s" },
    { "id": "r049", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2384, "src": "p := 1.00" },
    { "id": "r050", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2432, "src": "q := 2.50" },
    { "id": "r051", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2480, "src": "xi := 0.02" },
    { "id": "r052", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2528, "src": "I := 1.0" },
    { "id": "r053", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2576, "src": "T_1 := 0.1762 s" },
    { "id": "r054", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2624, "src": "Gamma_1 := 0.8189" },
    { "id": "r055", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2672, "src": "phi_12 := 1.5239" },
    { "id": "r056", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2720, "src": "T_2 := 0.0727 s" },
    { "id": "r057", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2768, "src": "Gamma_2 := 0.1811" },
    { "id": "r058", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2816, "src": "phi_22 := -1.3687" },
    { "id": "r059", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2864, "src": "f_xi := (0.05/xi)^0.4 = " },
    { "id": "r060", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2912, "src": "Sa_1 := A_r*S*(1 + r*(T_1/T_0)^p)/(1 + (T_1/T_0)^q) = " },
    { "id": "r061", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 2960, "src": "Sd_1 := I*Sa_1*f_xi*(9.80665 m/s^2)*(T_1/(2*pi))^2 = mm" },
    { "id": "r062", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3008, "src": "Sa_2 := A_r*S*(1 + r*(T_2/T_0)^p)/(1 + (T_2/T_0)^q) = " },
    { "id": "r063", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3056, "src": "Sd_2 := I*Sa_2*f_xi*(9.80665 m/s^2)*(T_2/(2*pi))^2 = mm" },
    { "id": "r064", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3104, "src": "Derivas por modo (Γ·Δφ·Sd) y combinación SRSS — ρ₁₂ = 0,0017: los modos están tan separados que la CQC coincide con la SRSS." },
    { "id": "r065", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3152, "src": "dr_1 := sqrt((Gamma_1*1*Sd_1)^2 + (Gamma_2*1*Sd_2)^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "r066", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3200, "src": "dr_2 := sqrt((Gamma_1*(phi_12 - 1)*Sd_1)^2 + (Gamma_2*(phi_22 - 1)*Sd_2)^2) = mm" },
    { "id": "v_cepa1_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3248, "src": "v_cepa1_cumple := dr_1 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "v_cepa2_cumple", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3296, "src": "v_cepa2_cumple := dr_2 <= d_max = " },
    { "id": "r069", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3344, "src": "uso_cepa := dr_1/d_max = " },
    { "id": "r070", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3392, "src": "La cepa cumple usando el 16 %: en una estructura arriostrada, §6 confirma; en un marco de momento, dimensiona." },
    { "id": "r071", "kind": "text", "x": 40, "y": 3440, "src": "— CONTRASTES contra los números publicados en el post —" },
    { "id": "c_dmax", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3488, "src": "abs(d_max - 60 mm) < 0.005 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_razonY2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3536, "src": "abs(razon_Y2 - 2.82) < 0.005 = " },
    { "id": "c_usoCBF", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3584, "src": "abs(uso_CBF - 0.17) < 0.005 = " },
    { "id": "c_Dgemela", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3632, "src": "abs(D_gemela - 665 mm) < 0.5 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_Drigida", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3680, "src": "abs(D_rigida - 470 mm) < 0.5 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_Sd1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3728, "src": "abs(Sd_1 - 12.1 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_Sd2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3776, "src": "abs(Sd_2 - 1.5 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_dr1", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3824, "src": "abs(dr_1 - 9.9 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_dr2", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3872, "src": "abs(dr_2 - 5.2 mm) < 0.05 mm = " },
    { "id": "c_usoCepa", "kind": "math", "x": 40, "y": 3920, "src": "abs(uso_cepa - 0.16) < 0.005 = " }
  ]
}
